// RESULT-1: CONFIRMED (actual=0.9989738451620287)
// HYPOTHESIS-2: Hybrid introsort (median-of-three pivot + insertion sort for small arrays) improves performance and adaptability
// MECHANISM-2: Median-of-three avoids worst-case on sorted/reverse data; insertion sort is optimal for small subarrays
// EXPECT-2: performance_score > 0.98
